   1:Communication.c **** /* Communication.c
   2:Communication.c ****  * Multi-transport communication manager — THESIS PERMANENT
   3:Communication.c ****  *
   4:Communication.c ****  * Responsibilities:
   5:Communication.c ****  *   - USB CDC RX: frame parsing and command dispatch
   6:Communication.c ****  *   - Transport registry: fan-out SendSample to all enabled transports
   7:Communication.c ****  *   - State sync: send 0xCC state packet after every command so Python
   8:Communication.c ****  *                 only updates its UI once PSoC confirms the change
   9:Communication.c ****  */
  10:Communication.c **** 
